('MCQ', 'Which of the following is an example of a "zero-day exploit"?', 'A software vulnerability that has been publicly disclosed but for which no patch is available', 'A cyberattack that targets a specific individual or organization', 'A type of malware that spreads rapidly across multiple systems', 'A security flaw that is exploited before the software vendor is aware of it', 'A security flaw that is exploited before the software vendor is aware of it',5),
