('MCQ', 'What does the term "two-factor authentication" refer to in cybersecurity?', 'A security measure that requires users to authenticate using two different methods', 'A type of malware that spreads through email attachments', 'A cryptographic technique used to protect data during transmission', 'A social engineering attack that involves tricking individuals into revealing sensitive information', 'A security measure that requires users to authenticate using two different methods',5);
